{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "ad290910-b7ef-4f9a-b060-a2585a8fd784",
      "name": "Wallets",
      "description": {
        "content": "**`Wallets` represent the blockchain wallet that holds the assets of an `Account`.**\n\nAn `Account` may be connected to a single `Wallet`.\n\nIndividual `Entities` can connect their self-custodied `Wallets` by proving ownership of the `Wallet` address.\nFor Dinari Partners, a Dinari-managed `Wallet` can be created for the Partner `Entity` in the [Dinari Partners Portal](https://Partners.dinari.com/). This may be used in omnibus accounting for self-managing customers' assets.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
